<title>UK: Swiss Bank Corp sets warrants on Nestle.</title>
<headline>Swiss Bank Corp sets warrants on Nestle.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corporation has issued a total of four million American-style call warrants, on Nestle registered shares, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>20 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1375.00 SFR	     PREMIUM	8.18 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     5.35 SFR		  GEARING	12.8 X</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   19.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	08.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 20</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1370.00 SFR</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
